# TDD and review (this repo)

Load `camstack-workflow` first. Pure implementation goes to project agents
(`.claude/agents/`), never bare `general-purpose`.

## TDD (every implementation task)

1. Write a **discriminating** test that fails on the old code for the reason
   the change exists (RED).
2. Implement until GREEN.
3. **Disarm check:** remove the fix (or break the assertion) and confirm RED
   again — then restore. A suite that only passes because a fake supplied the
   missing value is not proof.
4. Specs live next to sources (`__tests__/*.spec.ts`). Run:
   - `npx vitest run <spec>` / `npm run test -w <pkg>` / `npm run test:scripts`
5. Before push: `npm run verify:push` GREEN (TS7 pins + affected tests). A
   local `tsc` is not the CI gate. **Viewer (`camstack/`):** before every
   commit and push, `npm run verify:push` GREEN in that checkout (TypeScript
   Check gates + `ui:check` on changed UI files) — `camstack-ui-viewer`.

Domain extras: addon → `camstack-addon`; `*.cap.ts` → `camstack-capability` +
codegen; UI → `camstack-ui` (+ admin/viewer) + `ui:check` / `ui:shots`
(+ viewer `verify:push`).

## Review loop (after each meaningful task)

Do **not** self-review the whole diff in the coordinator context. Dispatch a
fresh reviewer with a crafted brief (plan + file list + what “done” means),
no session history.

| Severity | Action |
| --- | --- |
| Critical / Important | Fix immediately; scoped re-review of the fix diff |
| Minor | Note for later; do not block the next task |

**Stop the fix→re-review cycle only when the reviewer reports no new Critical
or Important findings** (or every remaining finding is ruled with a recorded
reason). Cap: ~5 fix rounds; after round 3 prefer a fresh implementer on a
stronger model. Final whole-change review once before ship.

Cursor mapping (agents → `Task` tool):

- Implement: `camstack-implementer` / `camstack-ui-engineer` / `camstack-test-fixer`
- Review: `code-reviewer` (or Bugbot / Security Review only when the operator
  asked for those by name)
- Docs chores: `camstack-docs-writer`

**Models:** see `camstack-model-routing.mdc` — cheap catalog slug for
implement/docs/test-fix/UI build; `inherit` for review/diagnose; never pin
Anthropic for every Task.

**UI (any agent, including a generic coordinator):** before the first edit
`npm run ui:shots -- … --label before`; after
`… --label after --compare scratchpad/ui-shots/before`; then **Read the
PNG paths** (light+dark × desktop+phone). Pasting only `report.md` is not
done. Details: `camstack-ui` skill §2 step 6 and done-gate.

## Ship after green review

Path B `deploy --closure` vs Path A publish: see
`camstack-ship-channel.mdc`. Never “published but not deployed”.
